{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"滤范畴"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"滤范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>滤范畴是满足如下等价条件的范畴 $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ 中所有"},{"Local":{"url":"有限范畴","text":"有限"}},{"Plain":"图都有锥;</li>\n<li>在 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 中, 以 $\\mathcal C$ 为指标范畴的余极限与所有"},{"Local":{"url":"有限范畴","text":"有限"}},{"Plain":"极限交换.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>依惯例, "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"语境下 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 改用 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}